 {'idx': 5, 'is_supporting': True, 'paragraph_text': "Saputo Inc. Saputo Inc. is a Montreal-based Canadian dairy company founded in 1954 by the Saputo family. Currently, Saputo produces, markets, and distributes a wide array of dairy products, including cheese, fluid milk, extended shelf-life milk and cream products, cultured products and dairy ingredients. It is one of the top ten dairy processors in the world. After growing in its home region of Quebec, the company has expanded predominantly through mergers and acquisitions. Saputo operates in Canada, the United States, Argentina, and Australia, and the company's products are sold in over 40 countries worldwide. It also operated in the UK", 'title': 'Saputo Inc.'}
