 {'idx': 4, 'is_supporting': False, 'paragraph_text': 'case of tie ballot, the eldest one shall be chosen. Porto Alegre Book Fair The Porto Alegre Book Fair is a book fair held annually, between late October to mid-November, in Porto Alegre, Brazil. It is the biggest open-space book fair in Latin America and the most important cultural event in Porto Alegre. The Porto Alegre Book Fair has been hosted in Porto Alegre downtown since its first edition. Nowadays, the Fair sprawls itself between the Alfândega Square, the Sepúlveda Avenue and some docks at Porto Alegre Harbor. The Porto Alegre Book Fair was an idea from Say Marques, then', 'title': 'Porto Alegre Book Fair'}
